@startuml paquetes-capas
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "events" as events
package "libs" as libs
package "models" as models
package "controllers" as controllers
package "views" as views
package "core" as core

models --> libs
controllers --> models
controllers --> libs
controllers --> events
views --> controllers
views --> models
views --> libs
views --> events
core --> controllers
core --> views
core --> models
core --> libs
core --> events

note bottom of events
  Sin dependencias — hoja del grafo.
  Cualquier capa puede importarlo.
end note

note bottom of core
  Composition Root — única capa que conoce
  implementaciones concretas de todas las demás.
  Nadie la importa (DAG sin ciclos).
end note
@enduml
